notes.content:
1. After collecting the fragments of the Secret Edict 1 and 2, you can obtain the Secret Edict Fragment 3 after completing level 37 Nightmare difficulty, trigger the plot, and obtain the Divine General Xiang Yu;
2. Modify the introduction of item 123 in the remaining volume of the secret edict;
3. Fixed the issue where some players displayed incorrect product information while viewing the Merit Store;
4. Merit shops add large meatballs of force and intelligence for exchange;
5. Reset the levels of Nian Beast, Ji An, Lady Li, and Zhao Bonu's two Zhou Mu;
6. The maximum number of players in the Kunlun Mirror dungeon has increased from 10 generals to 13 generals;
7. The Merit Shop has added the Return to Source special skill book exchange.

Update content

1. The difficulty of 1-30 levels of simple mode was lowered again;

2. The property of city gate was adjusted by 24;

3. Added the first level of props when the plot performance;

4. The props given by the 2nd and 3rd levels were removed and collected in the menu gift bag instead;

5. Send General Li Guangfei as a gift on army day. Go to the gift bag to collect it.

The contents of this update are as follows:

1. Fixed the problem of directly entering 27 levels after clicking start game;

2. Fixed 27 levels of game flashback problem;

3. Fixed the problem that there are only normal and difficult difficulties after updating the game, and no consumables are provided.

4. Distribution of welfare packages: Xingshi pill * 2, cod fish pill * 2, brown bear pill * 2, cheetah pill * 2, roast chicken leg * 2, dongma wine * 2

If you have any questions, please contact QQ customer service: 392788593

Hello everyone, this is the first update since we put it on the shelves. 
The details of the update are as follows:

1. Fixed the problem that a small number of players could not open the client and the game flashback;

2. Fixed the problem that the number of rounds does not end in some levels;

3. Redraw the maps of the 7th, 10th, 12th, 15th, 19th, 20th and 29th levels to improve the art quality;

4. Five kinds of ball props (fruit) have been added to the level store, and the prices of some props have been greatly reduced;

5. Adjusted the problem of loop in a certain layer after exiting the replica in Kunlun fantasy.

6. Fixed client startup icon display issue.

If it is found that it cannot be updated normally, uninstall and reload it. If you want to keep the archive, please copy out the archive folder

After output, uninstall and reload, and then cover the output folder. Sorry for the inconvenience.

If you have any questions about the above content, please contact my email: 392788593@qq.com, 
we willAccording to the reasonable suggestions of the players, continue to improve the game, 
thank you for your support!
